Why Functions?

Avoid duplicate code.

Bad Example:

df -h
df -h
df -h

Good Example:

check_disk() {
    df -h
}

check_disk

Production Example
restart_nginx() {
    systemctl restart nginx
}

check_nginx() {

    systemctl is-active nginx

    if [ $? -ne 0 ]
    then
        restart_nginx
    fi
}
